  message: "Completed in commit ccf60c39f (feat(rust): SCIP → stable_id mapping helper). compute_rust_stable_id_from_source reuses rust.py's extraction helpers verbatim for guaranteed parity. 4 tests pass: (1) parity across all functions in a multi-function sample covering top-level/impl/trait-impl, (2) trait-impl vs inherent-impl span disambiguation, (3) no-match-at-span returns None, (4) tree-sitter-unavailable graceful degradation. Macro-expanded items explicitly out of scope (not in SCIP per WI-zakub). Unblocks WI-duzul (package scaffold)."  # 2be2
